justification.md
  # Gaming PC - Justification

## CPU
The AMD Ryzen 5 7600X was selected because it provides excellent gaming performance and high clock speeds.
Its 6 cores and 12 threads are suitable for gaming, streaming, and multitasking.

### Alternative Component
AMD Ryzen 5 7600 offers similar gaming performance with lower power consumption.

### Future Upgrade
AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D would significantly improve gaming performance because of its 3D V-Cache technology.

---

## CPU Cooler
The Thermalright Aqua Elite 360 V3 was selected because it provides strong cooling performance for high-frequency gaming CPUs.
The 360mm radiator helps maintain low temperatures during gaming sessions.

### Alternative Component
ARCTIC Liquid Freezer III Pro 420 offers larger radiator size and improved cooling performance.

### Future Upgrade
MSI MAG CORELIQUID E360 provides premium cooling and RGB features.

---

## Motherboard
The ASRock B650 Steel Legend WiFi motherboard was selected because it supports modern AMD Ryzen processors and DDR5 memory.
It also includes WiFi connectivity and multiple M.2 storage slots.

### Alternative Component
ASUS ROG STRIX B850-F Gaming WiFi offers stronger VRM cooling and additional premium features.

### Future Upgrade
A higher-end B850 motherboard would improve future CPU upgrade support.

---

## RAM
32GB DDR5 6000MHz memory was selected because it provides high-speed performance for gaming and streaming.
DDR5 memory improves responsiveness and loading times.

### Alternative Component
G.SKILL Flare X5 DDR5 6000 provides similar gaming performance.

### Future Upgrade
64GB DDR5 memory could improve heavy multitasking and content creation workloads.

---

## Storage
The ADATA HV620S 2TB HDD was selected because it provides additional storage space for games and media files.
Its USB 3.2 interface allows fast external connectivity.

### Alternative Component
Crucial P3 Plus 2TB NVMe SSD offers much faster loading speeds.

### Future Upgrade
Crucial T500 2TB NVMe SSD would improve game loading and overall system responsiveness.

---

## GPU
The Zotac RTX 5060 8GB graphics card was selected because it provides strong 1440p gaming performance and supports DLSS 4 technology.
It is suitable for modern games and streaming.

### Alternative Component
ASRock Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB provides more VRAM and competitive gaming performance.

### Future Upgrade
ASUS Radeon RX 9060 XT PRIME OC or RTX 5070 Ti would improve performance in high-resolution gaming.

---

## Power Supply
The MSI MAG A850GL 850W PSU was selected because it provides enough power for gaming components and future upgrades.
Its 80+ Gold certification improves power efficiency.

### Alternative Component
Super Flower Leadex III Gold offers similar efficiency and reliability.

### Future Upgrade
Corsair RM750e provides premium build quality and quiet operation.

---

## Case
The Fractal Design Pop Air RGB case was selected because it provides excellent airflow and modern RGB aesthetics.
Its mesh front panel improves cooling performance.

### Alternative Component
The magenta version of the same case offers different aesthetics with similar airflow.

### Future Upgrade
MONTECH KING 95 PRO ARGB offers additional airflow and interior space.

---

## Monitor
The Alienware AW3425DWM monitor was selected because of its ultrawide 3440x1440 resolution and 180Hz refresh rate.
It provides immersive gaming experience and smooth gameplay.

### Alternative Component
MSI MAG 274CQF offers a more compact 27-inch gaming display.

### Future Upgrade
LG UltraGear OLED 240Hz monitor would improve image quality and motion clarity.

---

## Keyboard and Mouse
The SteelSeries Apex 3 keyboard and Razer Basilisk V3 mouse were selected because they are designed for gaming performance and comfort.
They provide RGB lighting, programmable controls, and fast response times.

### Alternative Component
Redragon Antonium Pro K728 PRO and SteelSeries Rival 3 Gen2 provide wireless gaming features.

### Future Upgrade
Logitech G515 LIGHTSPEED TKL and Logitech G502 X LIGHTSPEED offer premium wireless gaming performance.

